  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 minutes.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add butter and baby spinach leaves and stir to combine until butter is melted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd24cf29e0dfdacc797f6d-2b725927.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber. Cut plain tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. When the oil is hot, cook tofu and Mumbai spice blend tossing occasionally, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl. TIP: The spice blend will char slightly in the pan, this adds to the flavour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd24cf29e0dfdacc797f6d-681c08bf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add mild curry paste and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add coconut milk, the brown sugar and a splash of water and cook, stirring, until heated through, 1-2 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine cucumber, sweetcorn, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd24cf29e0dfdacc797f6d-8582787b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide spinach rapid rice, tofu, and cucumber salsa between bowls.\n• Pour korma sauce over tofu to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd24cf29e0dfdacc797f6d-a6322e53.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
